WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.047
Today we will communicate ideas through body movement. Our work connects with

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.259
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.359
Choose a character and identify one important action.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.549
Try three gestures that communicate the action without words.

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:20.359
Show your gesture sequence while a friend identifies the story. Explain one

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:23.687
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
